    "title": "Yuma police continue to seek tips in unsolved hit-and-run that killed 18-year-old - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lauren Duffel ,\n23 hours ago YUMA,Ariz.(KYMA)-This month marks five years since an 18-year-old Yuma man was killed in a hit-and-run that remains unsolved. Yuma police say Alan Cunningham was riding his bike with friends when they were struck by a vehicle. Cunningham tragically passed away, and the driver of that vehicle has still not come forward. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
